### contrat-service — exemples de requêtes (REST Client VSCode / IntelliJ HTTP)
###
### Générer un JWT de test (secret partagé educa_access_secret_2026) :
###
###   node -e "console.log(require('jsonwebtoken').sign({userId:'11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111',schoolId:'22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222',roleCode:'DIRECTEUR'},'educa_access_secret_2026',{expiresIn:'2h'}))"
###
###   node -e "console.log(require('jsonwebtoken').sign({userId:'33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333',schoolId:'99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999999',roleCode:'SUPER_ADMIN'},'educa_access_secret_2026',{expiresIn:'2h'}))"
###
### Puis coller les valeurs ci-dessous.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8091/api/v1
@token = COLLER_LE_JWT_DIRECTEUR
@adminToken = COLLER_LE_JWT_SUPER_ADMIN
@contractTypeIdPersonnel = COLLER_UN_ID_DE_TYPE_PERSONNEL
@contractTypeIdEtab = COLLER_UN_ID_DE_TYPE_ETABLISSEMENT
@contractId = COLLER_UN_ID_DE_CONTRAT
@subjectSchoolId = 44444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444

### Santé (publique)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Référentiel des types de contrat
GET {{baseUrl}}/contract-types
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Créer un contrat PERSONNEL (DRAFT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/contracts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contractTypeId": "{{contractTypeIdPersonnel}}",
  "title": "Contrat enseignant - Jean Baptiste",
  "startDate": "2026-09-01",
  "durationDays": 300,
  "amount": 25000,
  "currency": "HTG"
}

### Créer un contrat ETABLISSEMENT (admin EDUCA requis)
POST {{baseUrl}}/contracts
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contractTypeId": "{{contractTypeIdEtab}}",
  "title": "Abonnement SaaS 2026",
  "subjectSchoolId": "{{subjectSchoolId}}",
  "startDate": "2026-01-01",
  "amount": 120000
}

### Liste paginée + filtres
GET {{baseUrl}}/contracts?page=1&limit=20&status=DRAFT
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Lister les contrats d'établissement d'une école
GET {{baseUrl}}/contracts?scope=ETABLISSEMENT&subjectSchoolId={{subjectSchoolId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Détail
GET {{baseUrl}}/contracts/{{contractId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Mise à jour (uniquement en DRAFT)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/contracts/{{contractId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Contrat enseignant - Jean Baptiste (révisé)",
  "amount": 27000
}

### Ajouter une partie
POST {{baseUrl}}/contracts/{{contractId}}/parties
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "partyType": "PERSON",
  "roleInContract": "EMPLOYE",
  "fullName": "Jean Baptiste",
  "email": "jean@ecole.ht"
}

### Transition d'état (machine à états) — DRAFT -> PENDING_APPROVAL
POST {{baseUrl}}/contracts/{{contractId}}/transition
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "toStatus": "PENDING_APPROVAL",
  "reason": "Soumis pour approbation"
}

### Upload d'un document (multipart)
POST {{baseUrl}}/contracts/{{contractId}}/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----boundary

------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="type"

ORIGINAL
------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="contrat.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./storage/sample/contrat.pdf
------boundary--

### Lister les documents
GET {{baseUrl}}/contracts/{{contractId}}/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Historique des statuts + audit
GET {{baseUrl}}/contracts/{{contractId}}/history
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# =====================================================================
# Phase 2 — Modèles (templates) + Signature électronique
# =====================================================================

@templateId = COLLER_UN_ID_DE_TEMPLATE
@requestId = COLLER_UN_ID_DE_DEMANDE_SIGNATURE
@signatoryId = COLLER_UN_ID_DE_SIGNATAIRE

### Lister les modèles (prédéfinis + école)
GET {{baseUrl}}/templates?scopeOwner=PREDEFINED&limit=100
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Détail d'un modèle (+ versions)
GET {{baseUrl}}/templates/{{templateId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Variables détectées dans un modèle
GET {{baseUrl}}/templates/{{templateId}}/variables
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cloner un modèle prédéfini (rôle gestionnaire requis)
POST {{baseUrl}}/templates/{{templateId}}/duplicate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Mon CDI école" }

### Créer un modèle école
POST {{baseUrl}}/templates
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Contrat maison",
  "contractTypeId": "{{contractTypeIdPersonnel}}",
  "body": "<h1>Contrat</h1><p>{{employee_name}}, poste {{employee_function}}. Salaire {{salary}} {{currency}} ({{salary_in_words}}). Fait le {{today}}.</p>"
}

### Publier un modèle
POST {{baseUrl}}/templates/{{templateId}}/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Prévisualiser (HTML) avec données d'exemple
POST {{baseUrl}}/templates/{{templateId}}/preview
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "format": "html", "sampleData": { "employee_name": "Marie Claire", "school_name": "Collège Test" } }

### Créer un contrat DEPUIS un modèle (génère rendered_body + PDF)
POST {{baseUrl}}/contracts/from-template
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "templateId": "{{templateId}}",
  "title": "CDI Jean Baptiste",
  "startDate": "2026-09-01",
  "amount": 25000,
  "currency": "HTG",
  "variables": {
    "employee_name": "Jean Baptiste",
    "employee_function": "Enseignant",
    "school_name": "Collège Test",
    "director_name": "Mme Directrice"
  },
  "parties": [
    { "partyType": "PERSON", "roleInContract": "EMPLOYE", "fullName": "Jean Baptiste", "email": "jean@ecole.ht" }
  ]
}

### Télécharger le PDF d'un contrat
GET {{baseUrl}}/contracts/{{contractId}}/pdf
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ouvrir une demande de signature (contrat en APPROVED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/contracts/{{contractId}}/signature-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mode": "PARALLEL",
  "deadline": "2026-09-15",
  "signatories": [
    { "name": "Employeur", "email": "employeur@ecole.ht" },
    { "name": "Employé", "email": "employe@ecole.ht" }
  ]
}

### Signatures disponibles de l'utilisateur (via signature-service), flag par défaut
GET {{baseUrl}}/contracts/{{contractId}}/available-signatures
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Statut des signatures d'un contrat
GET {{baseUrl}}/contracts/{{contractId}}/signatures
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Signer avec la signature PAR DÉFAUT (confirmation obligatoire). Tous signés → ACTIVE
POST {{baseUrl}}/signature-requests/{{requestId}}/sign
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "signatoryId": "{{signatoryId}}", "confirmed": true }

### Signer avec une signature CHOISIE (signatureId du service 8093)
POST {{baseUrl}}/signature-requests/{{requestId}}/sign
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "signatoryId": "{{signatoryId}}", "confirmed": true, "signatureId": "ID_SIGNATURE_8093" }

### Relancer un signataire
POST {{baseUrl}}/signature-requests/{{requestId}}/remind
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "signatoryId": "{{signatoryId}}" }
